:r(1,6),f:"18:00",t:"20:00",x:"All cocktails 50% off"}]},{n:"The Pitch",a:"Praha 2",ad:"Je\u010Dn\xE1 12",ty:"Cocktail bar and club",c:"venue",p:null,src:["pit","bav"],note:"Its own page says Monday to Friday. A listing says daily, and adds cocktails at 99 K\u010D every evening until midnight. Club nights have a second happy hour, 22:00\u201323:00 on selected events: chupito 30 K\u010D, three cocktails 99 K\u010D.",w:[{d:r(0,4),f:"17:00",t:"20:00",x:"50% off cocktails"}]},{n:"Hard Rock Cafe Praha",a:"Praha 1",ad:"Mal\xE9 n\xE1m\u011Bst\xED 142/3",ty:"Bar and restaurant",c:"venue",p:null,src:["hrc","prg","bav"],note:'Three sources agree on the times. None gives prices. The menu file is named "50 percent off", but the page text does not confirm a discount.',w:[{d:r(0,3),f:"17:00",t:"19:00",x:"Beer, local wine, selected shots and cocktails at reduced prices"},{d:r(0,3),f:"21:00",t:"22:00",x:"Beer, local wine, selected shots and cocktails at reduced prices"}]},{n:"Slivovitz Museum",a:"Praha 1",ad:"U Lu\u017Eick\xE9ho semin\xE1\u0159e 116",ty:"Museum bar",c:"venue",p:125,src:["sli"],note:"Found on the venue's menu page, which may be seasonal. Deal cocktails: Hugo Spritz, Sweet and Spicy, Cherry Spritz, Plum Cocktail and Boston.",w:[{d:r(0,6),f:"15:00",t:"17:00",x:"Selected cocktails 125 K\u010D"}]},{n:"ALIBI Cocktail & Music Bar",a:"Praha 1",ad:"\u017Ditn\xE1 1575/49",ty:"Cocktail bar",c:"conflict",p:109,src:["ali","got","bav"],fr:"ALIBI",note:'Its own page header shows it open Wednesday to Saturday only, which fits Thursday to Saturday happy hours and 1+1 on Wednesdays. Its menu text says "every day", and a ticketing page says 18:00\u201320:00, "selected cocktails for 59". Shown here as the opening days suggest.',w:[{d:[3,4,5],f:"19:00",t:"21:00",x:"Cocktails 109 K\u010D"},{d:[2],f:"19:00",t:"02:00",x:"1+1 free drink"}]},{n:"Zone Cocktail & Music Bar",a:"Praha 1",ad:"K\u0159emencova 178/10",ty:"Cocktail bar",c:"venue",p:99,src:["zon","bav"],fr:"Zone Cocktail",note:'Its own page shows "Happy Hours 99 K\u010D, 18\u201321, Wednesday to Saturday". A listing agrees.',w:[{d:r(2,5),f:"18:00",t:"21:00",x:"Selected cocktails 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Nebe Celnice",a:"Praha 1",ad:"V Celnici 4",ty:"Cocktail and music bar",c:"listing",p:99,src:["bav"],note:"The venue's own page does not mention the offer. The listing says 18:00, but Google Maps shows the bar opening at 19:00, so the start is shown as 19:00.",w:[{d:r(0,5),f:"19:00",t:"23:00",x:"Cocktails from 99 K\u010D. Chupito 1+1 for 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"La Bodeguita Del Medio",a:"Praha 1",ad:"Kaprova 5",ty:"Music bar",c:"listing",p:99,src:["bav"],note:"",w:[{d:[2,3],f:"19:00",t:"23:00",x:"Selected music-bar cocktails 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Gossip Bar",a:"Praha 2",ad:"\u0160t\u011Bp\xE1nsk\xE1 538/11",ty:"Cocktail bar",c:"venue",p:139,src:["gos"],fr:"Gossip",note:"Its own page says every day, 16:00\u201301:00, all cocktails 139 K\u010D. Google Maps shows different opening hours.",w:[{d:r(0,6),f:"16:00",t:"01:00",x:"All cocktails 139 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Aloha Bar",a:"Praha 1",ad:"Du\u0161n\xED 11",ty:"Cocktail bar",c:"listing",p:99,src:["alo","bav"],note:"The venue's events page shows a Happy Hours image, but the page text states no days, times or prices.",w:[{d:r(2,5),f:"19:00",t:"22:00",x:"Cocktails from 99 K\u010D"},{d:r(2,5),f:"19:00",t:"24:00",x:"Ladies night, cocktails from 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Hangar",a:"Praha 1",ad:"Du\u0161n\xED 9",ty:"Cocktail bar",c:"listing",p:99,src:["han","bav"],note:"The venue's events page shows a Happy Hours image, but the page text states no days, times or prices.",w:[{d:r(2,5),f:"19:00",t:"22:00",x:"Cocktails from 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Kav\xE1rna Velryba",a:"Praha 1",ad:"Opatovick\xE1 156/24",ty:"Caf\xE9 bar",c:"listing",p:99,src:["bav"],note:"The venue's own page does not mention the offer. Google Maps shows Saturday opening at 17:00, so Saturday starts then.",w:[{d:r(0,4),f:"15:00",t:"18:00",x:"Drinks 99 K\u010D"},{d:[5],f:"17:00",t:"18:00",x:"Drinks 99 K\u010D"}]},{n:"Statio