Prague",k:["arcade","pool","darts","bowl","tt","video"],a:"N\xE1rodn\xED 63/26, Prague 1 (floors 3 to 5 of the M\xE1j building)",area:"N\xE1rodn\xED t\u0159\xEDda",hrs:"Mon\u2013Thu 11:00\u201300:00, Fri and Sat 10:00\u201302:00, Sun 10:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Karaoke box 990 K\u010D per hour. Private simulators 10 000 K\u010D per hour. No general prices for arcade, pool, darts or bowling",sd:"",d:"Entertainment house with 200+ arcade games, pool, darts including interactive darts, shuffleboard, duckpin bowling, minigolf, Formula and GT simulators, bumper cars, karaoke and an electric rodeo bull. Four bars and an American restaurant.",src:[n.lv],note:"Book single activities on the venue site. Opening hours are not listed on the page."},{id:"szz",n:"SkillZone \u017Di\u017Ekov",k:["video"],a:"Orebitsk\xE1 630/4, Prague 3",area:"\u017Di\u017Ekov",hrs:"Open 24/7 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Budget PC 59 K\u010D per hour (promo said to run until 15 Nov, H\xE1je and Stod\u016Flky only). Premium 69 K\u010D per hour after a 1 000 K\u010D top-up. Other tiers: see the price list",sd:"Nov 2026",d:"Gaming club with 27 PCs: 12 VIP seats (27 inch 2.5K 240 Hz), 5 Esport seats (up to 380 Hz) and 10 standard seats. Bar with drinks and food. PCs only, no consoles.",src:[n.szn,n.sz]},{id:"szh",n:"SkillZone H\xE1je",k:["video"],a:"Arkalyck\xE1 877/4, Prague 4",area:"H\xE1je metro",hrs:"Daily 12:00\u201303:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Budget PC 59 K\u010D per hour (promo said to run until 15 Nov). Premium 69 K\u010D per hour after a 1 000 K\u010D top-up. Console prices not listed",sd:"Nov 2026",d:"Gaming club with 36 PCs (Esport, VIP, Budget and a 49 inch BOSS PC) plus consoles. Bootcamp room for private groups of 5 to 10 players, bookable by appointment.",src:[n.sz]},{id:"szs",n:"SkillZone Stod\u016Flky",k:["video"],a:"Prus\xEDkova 2577/16, Prague 5",area:"Stod\u016Flky",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 14:00\u201323:00, Sat 13:00\u201303:00, Sun 13:00\u201323:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Budget PC 59 K\u010D per hour (promo said to run until 15 Nov). Premium 69 K\u010D per hour after a 1 000 K\u010D top-up. Console prices not listed",sd:"Nov 2026",d:"Gaming club with 28 PCs (Esport, VIP and Budget) plus consoles.",src:[n.sz]},{id:"pz",n:"PLAYzone Arena (Westfield Chodov)",k:["video","board"],a:"Westfield Chodov, Prague 4 (street entrance by the Chodov bus stop)",area:"Chodov",hrs:"Sun\u2013Thu 11:00\u201322:00, Fri and Sat 11:00\u201301:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"",sd:"",d:"Esports bar and gaming centre with 55 PCs, 8 new-generation consoles, VR, 7 private gaming rooms and professional driving simulators. Free board game rental at reception and a bar with a big screen for esports matches.",src:[n.pz],note:"The page shows no date and carries the Vodafone brand, so the operator or name may have changed. ISIC card holders get 20% off credits and food and drink. Driving simulators are for ages 16+ and 160 cm or taller."},{id:"zl",n:"Zero Latency Prague",k:["video"],a:"Na Po\u0159\xED\u010D\xED 25, Prague 1",area:"Nov\xE9 M\u011Bsto",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 10:00\u201322:00, Sat 09:20\u201323:30, Sun 10:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"",sd:"",d:"Free-roam VR arena for 1 to 8 players with 7 game scenarios. Headset, controller and microphone, wireless, with sessions of 15 to 30 minutes. Age limit 8+ or 12+ depending on the game. Booking is not required but recommended.",src:[n.zl],note:"The page lists no price."},{id:"bbv",n:"Bohemia Boards & Brews, Vr\u0161ovice",k:["board","quiz"],a:"Charkovsk\xE1 18, Prague 10",area:"Vr\u0161ovice",hrs:"Closed Mon. Tue\u2013Fri 17:00\u201323:00, Sat 14:00\u201323:00, Sun 14:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"60 K\u010D game fee per bill: play as many games as you like for as long as you like",sd:"",d:"Prague's first board game caf\xE9, with 500+ party and strategy games, craft beer, cocktails and simple meals. Staff recommend games and teach the rules. Also runs pub quizzes.",src:[n.bb,n.bbe],note:"Prague City Tourism lists the hours and fee but shows no date. A second location is at Palmovka."},{id:"bbp",n:"Bohemia Boards & Brews, Palmovka",k:["board","quiz"],a:"Palmovka, Prague 8 (street address not found)",area:"Palmovka",hrs:"Mon 11:00\u201322:00, Tue\u2013Fri 11:00\u201323:00, Sat 12:00\u201323:00, Sun 16:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Quiz entry 100 K\u010D per the guide. Game fee not found for this branch",sd:"Oct 2026",d:"Second location of the board game pub, with board games and a pub quiz on Sundays at 19:00. Food includes burgers and sv\xED\u010Dkov\xE1.",src:[n.cc,n.qz]},{id:"dh",n:"Deskohub",k:["board"],a:"Palmovka, Prague 8 (street address not found)",area:"Palmovka",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 17:00\u201323:00, Sat and Sun 12:00\u201323:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"",sd:"Oct 2026",d:"Board game venue with several hundred games, drinks, and an adjoining coworking space.",src:[n.cc]},{id:"gk",n:"Geek\xE1rna",k:["board"],a:"Near And\u011Bl, by the U Zvonu stop, Prague 5 (street address not found)",area:"And\u011Bl",hrs:"Daily 15:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"",sd:"Oct 2026",d:"Board game caf\xE9 open for twelve years, with drinks inspired by films, books and series.",src:[n.cc]},{id:"gr",n:"The Grail",k:["board"],a:"Near Arbesovo n\xE1m\u011Bst\xED, Prague 5 (third floor, no elevator)",area:"Sm\xEDchov",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 17:00\u201300:00, Sat and Sun 13:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"",sd:"Oct 2026",d:"Tabletop gaming venue for Dungeons & Dragons and Warhammer, with small private rooms and large halls. Terrain and figures can be borrowed. Plze\u0148 beer on tap.",src:[n.cc]},{id:"na",n:"Nerd Alert",k:["board","quiz"],a:"Vr\u0161ovice, Prague 10 (street address not found)",area:"Vr\u0161ovice",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 17:00\u201300:00, Sat and Sun 14:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Quiz entry 100 K\u010D per the guide",sd:"Oct 2026",d:"Geek-themed pub with quiz nights (geek and TV trivia once or twice a month, other quizzes on varying weekdays at 19:00) and figurine-painting workshops. Kitchen serves food.",src:[n.cc,n.qz]},{id:"pk",n:"Pivovar Prokop\xE1k",k:["board"],a:"Do Klukovic 305, Prague 5",area:"Prague 5",hrs:"Mon\u2013Thu 11:00\u201321:30, Fri and Sat 11:00\u201322:00, Sun 11:00\u201320:30. Board game evening every Monday (time not listed) (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Game rental is free. Entry and beer prices not listed",sd:"",d:"Brewery pub with a weekly board game night, including Codenames, Carcassonne, Bang!, Dixit, Ubongo and Karak.",src:[n.pr],note:"The page shows no date."},{id:"bcv",n:"Billiard Centrum V C\xEDpu",k:["pool","tt","foos","darts","bowl"],a:"V C\xEDpu 1, Prague 1",area:"Near Wenceslas Square",hrs:"11:00\u201302:00",pr:"Expats.cz guide: pool 95\u2013125 K\u010D/h, carom 75\u201395 K\u010D, snooker 110\u2013150 K\u010D, Russian pyramid 125\u2013165 K\u010D, ping pong 80 K\u010D, bowling 200\u2013300 K\u010D per hour. Lower rates 11:00\u201317:00, higher 17:00\u201302:00. In Your Pocket says pool from 49 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"Large hall with 28 tables (18 pool, 3 carom, 2 snooker, 5 Russian pyramid), 7 ping pong tables, 2 bowling alleys, 3 foosball tables, 3 dart machines and a chess and poker room.",src:[n.bg,n.bc],note:"The two sources show no date and give different pool prices, so confirm before you go."},{id:"rip",n:"Billiard Club \u0158ipsk\xE1",k:["pool"],a:"\u0158ipsk\xE1 24, Prague 3",area:"Near Ji\u0159\xEDho z Pod\u011Bbrad",hrs:"Daily 13:00\u201301:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Pool 60\u2013130 K\u010D/h, carom 60\u2013115 K\u010D, snooker 130\u2013150 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"18 tables in the former Slavia cinema: 13 pool tables (8 ft and 9 ft), 4 carom and 1 snooker. Reserve by phone ideally a day ahead.",src:[n.bg],note:"The guide shows no date."},{id:"bal",n:"Billiard Club Balabu\u0161ka",k:["pool"],a:"Michelsk\xE1 19/16, Prague 4",area:"Michle",hrs:"Mon 14:00\u201301:00, Tue\u2013Sat 14:00\u201302:00, Sun 14:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Pool 59\u2013135 K\u010D/h, carom 59\u2013120 K\u010D, snooker 90\u2013150 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"14 tables: 11 Brunswick pool tables, 2 carom and 1 Willie Holt snooker table. Reserve by phone at least 14 hours ahead.",src:[n.bg],note:"The guide shows no date."},{id:"lou",n:"Caf\xE9 Louvre",k:["pool"],a:"N\xE1rodn\xED 22, Prague 1",area:"N\xE1rodn\xED t\u0159\xEDda",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 08:00\u201323:30, Sat and Sun 09:00\u201323:30 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:'Described as "very reasonable". No figures',sd:"",d:"Caf\xE9 with 5 billiard tables. Reservations recommended at least a day ahead.",src:[n.bg]},{id:"grb",n:"Grill Billiard Club",k:["pool"],a:"Kafkova 47, Prague 6",area:"Dejvice",hrs:"",pr:"",sd:"",d:"Small billiard club with 5 tables: 3 pool and 2 carom.",src:[n.bg]},{id:"bwr",n:"Bowling Bar, Rusk\xE1",k:["pool","bowl"],a:"Rusk\xE1 88, Prague 10",area:"Vr\u0161ovice",hrs:"Billiard room 15:00\u201324:00",pr:"Billiard 90 K\u010D per hour",sd:"",d:"Bowling bar with a separate billiard room of 4 tables: 3 pool and 1 carom.",src:[n.bg]},{id:"dej",n:"Bowling & Billiard Dejvice",k:["bowl","pool","darts","foos"],a:"B\xEDl\xE1 6 (entrance from Kolejn\xED), Prague 6",area:"Dejvice",hrs:"Mon\u2013Thu 13:00\u201300:00, Fri 13:00\u201301:00, Sat 11:00\u201301:00, Sun 11:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Per hour: Mon\u2013Thu 320 K\u010D (13\u201315), 450 K\u010D (15\u201317), 580 K\u010D (17\u201301). Fri\u2013Sun 450 K\u010D (11\u201317), 580 K\u010D (17\u201301). The page does not say what the fee covers",sd:"",d:"Six AMF bowling lanes, three pool tables, darts, table football, air hockey and boxing. Restaurant, summer garden, tournaments and dogs allowed.",src:[n.dej],note:"The page shows no date."},{id:"crew",n:"Crew Bar",k:["tt"],a:"Jir\xE1skovo n\xE1m\u011Bst\xED 4, Prague 2",area:"Nov\xE9 M\u011Bsto",hrs:"Mon, Tue, Sun 16:00\u201322:00. Wed, Thu 16:00\u201323:00. Fri, Sat 16:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Go City page lists up to 375 K\u010D for one hour of ping pong or shuffleboard without a pass. Included with some Go City passes",sd:"",d:"Bar with black-light ping pong or shuffleboard, one hour, two players minimum. Staff teach the shuffleboard rules. Reservations recommended.",src:[n.crew],note:"The page shows no date and the price is not clearly per person or per table."},{id:"buc",n:"Bucibar",k:["foos"],a:"Lubla\u0148sk\xE1 4, Prague 2",area:"Nov\xE9 M\u011Bsto",hrs:"14:00\u201302:00",pr:"",sd:"",d:"Bar with a foosball table toward the rear.",src:[n.buc],note:"The listing shows no date."},{id:"lkb",n:"Lokalblok",k:["foos"],a:"n\xE1m. 14. \u0159\xEDjna 10, Prague 5",area:"Sm\xEDchov",hrs:"Mon\u2013Sat 11:00\u201300:00, Sun 12:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Climbing wall 60 K\u010D per day. Foosball price not listed",sd:"",d:"Bar with a foosball table downstairs and a climbing wall.",src:[n.lok],note:"The listing shows no date."},{id:"bbd",n:"Beer and Bowling Diner",k:["bowl"],a:"Kongresov\xE1 1 (Corinthia Towers Hotel), Prague 4",area:"Pankr\xE1c",hrs:"14:00\u201324:00",pr:"",sd:"",d:"Ten-pin bowling in the Corinthia Towers hotel.",src:[n.bbd],note:"The listing shows no date."},{id:"hf",n:"Hit Fit Flora (table tennis)",k:["tt"],a:"Near Flora metro, Prague 3",area:"Flora",hrs:"",pr:"100 K\u010D per hour",sd:"2010",d:"Sports centre where you can rent a table tennis table by the hour.",src:[n.is],note:"This source is from 2010. Prices and opening may have changed. The article advises phoning ahead."},{id:"se",n:"Sport Centrum Evropsk\xE1 (table tennis)",k:["tt"],a:"Evropsk\xE1, near Divok\xE1 \u0160\xE1rka, Prague 6",area:"Divok\xE1 \u0160\xE1rka",hrs:"Mon\u2013Thu 07:00\u201322:00, Fri 07:00\u201321:00, Sat and Sun 08:00\u201321:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"90 K\u010D per hour",sd:"2010",d:"Sports centre where you can rent a table tennis table by the hour.",src:[n.is],note:"This source is from 2010. Prices and opening may have changed."},{id:"vy",n:"V\xFDletn\xE1, Letn\xE1 (table tennis)",k:["tt"],a:"Letn\xE1 Park, near the beer garden, Prague 7",area:"Letn\xE1",hrs:"Daily 06:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"80 K\u010D (time unit not stated)",sd:"2010",d:"One table tennis table near the Letn\xE1 beer garden.",src:[n.is],note:"This source is from 2010. Check it still exists."},{id:"at",n:"Art Together by Silvia Vezzuto",k:["art"],a:"Zaho\u0159ansk\xE9ho 7, Prague 1",area:"Nov\xE9 M\u011Bsto",hrs:"Bar Mon\u2013Fri 13:00\u201323:00, Sat 10:00\u201323:00, Sun 16:00\u201322:00. Painting evenings (such as Tuesday Art and Wine) by arrangement (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"859 K\u010D (listed as down from 1 200 K\u010D) for a 3-hour evening painting course with a glass of wine, for 1 to 2 people",sd:"",d:"Painting evening where you paint with a glass of wine, led by the artist. Reviewers on the page praise the friendly, flexible instructor.",src:[n.at],note:"The page shows no date and the price is a Slevomat offer, so confirm the current price. Some reviewers say it is mostly free painting with little technique taught. Not wheelchair accessible."},{id:"am",n:"ArtMoment Paint and Sip",k:["art"],a:"Caf\xE9s and restaurants in central Prague (venue shown per date when you book)",area:"Central Prague",hrs:"Several dates a week: weekday evenings, weekend afternoons",pr:"From 1 690 K\u010D per person, everything included",sd:"",d:"Guided painting evening of about 3 hours. You get a welcome drink, a 40 by 50 cm canvas, acrylic paints, an easel and an apron, and take your painting home that night. No Czech needed. Ask for an English-speaking lecturer in the order note, which is not guaranteed.",src:[n.am],note:"The page shows no date. It does not say whether food and drink are included in the price."},{id:"al",n:"ArtLab by ArtMoment",k:["art"],a:"Vnitroblock, Tusarova 31, Prague 7 (floor -1, left of the bar)",area:"Hole\u0161ovice",hrs:"Daily 10:00\u201320:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"599 K\u010D on weekdays, 699 K\u010D at weekends for a 1.5-hour booking. Canvas 590\u20132 190 K\u010D extra, special paints 119 K\u010D per colour",sd:"Nov 2026",d:"Studio where you book a workstation and make one painting with an instructor, using pendulum, spiral, balloon-pop, pouring or freestyle techniques. Overalls and shoe covers provided. Collect the painting after 3 to 7 days of drying or have it couriered.",src:[n.al],note:"The page shows no date, but its price list file is named for November 2026."},{id:"pp",n:"Paint & Play Praha",k:["art"],a:"Braunerova 1, Prague 8",area:"Libe\u0148",hrs:"Daily 11:00\u201319:00, by online reservation only",pr:"From 899 K\u010D, varies by technique and canvas size",sd:"",d:"Creative painting studio with playful techniques: darts at paint-filled balloons, painting from a bicycle, a swinging paint pendulum and fluid paints. Materials, protective gear and packing of the finished painting are included.",src:[n.pp],note:"The listing shows no date. The studio is closed without a prior online reservation."},{id:"kr",n:"Kera self-service ceramics studio",k:["art"],a:"Veletr\u017En\xED 207/11, Prague 7",area:"Hole\u0161ovice",hrs:"Daily 8:00\u201322:00",pr:"Modelling and decorating 300 K\u010D per hour, potter's wheel 400 K\u010D per hour. Ready-made pieces to decorate from 180 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"Self-service pottery studio with no instructor on site. Create an account, top up credit, book a slot and open the door with a code. Free consultations with an instructor on Mondays 18:00\u201321:00.",src:[n.kr],note:"The page shows no date."},{id:"sf",n:"SlouFlou Workshop (pottery and creative space)",k:["art"],a:"Vinohrady, Prague 2 (street address not listed)",area:"Vinohrady",hrs:"Mon\u2013Fri 11:00\u201318:00, closed Sat and Sun (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Space rental from 370 K\u010D per hour. Workshop prices not listed",sd:"",d:"Creative studio with five pottery wheels and two kilns, used for pottery sessions, art therapy, ceramic painting, courses and team events. Capacity up to 24 seated.",src:[n.sf],note:"This is mainly a venue-rental listing. Ask the studio about public sessions."},{id:"fa",n:"Fine Art Studio (courses and workshops)",k:["art"],a:"Balb\xEDnova 28, Prague 2",area:"Vinohrady",hrs:"Classes in 120-minute blocks, weekday afternoons and evenings. Workshops on set dates",pr:"Workshops 1 500\u20133 500 K\u010D, for example drawing a nude model with a glass of wine 800 K\u010D",sd:"Nov 2026",d:"Art school with semester courses and one-off workshops: painting, pastel, calligraphy, mosaic, stained glass, silk painting and a pottery wheel course. Website in Czech and English, with a free trial lesson advertised. Dated workshops are in the Events tab.",src:[n.fa2]},{id:"ld",n:"Life Drawing Session (Kresba \u017Divot), Steiner Hall",k:["art"],a:"Hybernsk\xE1 7, Prague 1 (Steiner Hall, Lidov\xFD d\u016Fm, first floor through the courtyard)",area:"Nov\xE9 M\u011Bsto",hrs:"Date and time not listed on the page",pr:"Entry 200 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"Uninstructed life drawing for all levels, with poses from quick 2 to 6 minute sketches to 10 to 20 minutes. Bring your own materials and a drink.",src:[n.ld],note:"The page lists no date. Check the event page for the next session."},o("q1","Third Coast Pizza","\u017Di\u017Ekov, Prague 3","Wednesdays, 19:15"),o("q2","The Down Under","Vinohradsk\xE1, Vinohrady, Prague 2","Thursdays 19:00, themed quizzes every other Monday"),o("q3","Beckett's Irish Pub","A block south of N\xE1m\u011Bst\xED M\xEDru, Prague 2","Thursdays, 19:00"),o("q4","Sally O'Brien's Irish Pub","Letn\xE1, Prague 7","Sundays, 19:30"),o("q5","Manifesto Market And\u011Bl","And\u011Bl, Prague 5","Twice a month on Tuesdays, 19:00"),o("q6","Philly and Co's Original Cheesesteaks","\u017Di\u017Ekov entrance of the V\xEDtkov tunnel, Prague 3","Tuesdays, 19:00"),o("q7","James Joyce Irish Pub","North side of New Town, Prague 1","Mondays, 19:00"),o("q8","Clown and Bard Hostel","\u017Di\u017Ekov, Prague 3","Thursdays, 19:00"),o("q9","The Cabin Bar","Vinohrady, Prague 2","Every other Tuesday, 19:30"),o("q10","The Globe Bookstore and Caf\xE9","Address not stated","Wednesdays, 19:00"),{id:"kcr",n:"Kart Centrum Radot\xEDn",k:["kart"],a:"Radot\xEDn, southern edge of Prague (street address not stated)",area:"Radot\xEDn, about 35 minutes by road from the centre",hrs:"Daily 11:00\u201300:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"250 K\u010D per 10 minutes per person, walk-in",sd:"7 May 2026",d:"Indoor go-kart venue in a converted greenhouse. In Your Pocket says Prague City Tourism lists it as home to the longest indoor kart track in Europe: a 910 m main circuit with more than 30 turns, plus a shorter 300 m track for younger drivers.",src:[n.iyk],note:"The article gives no opening hours and says the venue is mostly cash. Check before you go."},{id:"kpa",n:"Praga Arena",k:["kart"],a:"Kyje, eastern Prague (street address not stated)",area:"Kyje",hrs:"Daily 10:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Around 200 K\u010D per 10 minutes. Cash only per the article",sd:"7 May 2026",d:"Specialist karting facility with four track configurations and a combined indoor and outdoor circuit of 934 m. Has a restaurant with a glass wall overlooking the track.",src:[n.iyk],note:"The article gives no opening hours."},{id:"kcm",n:"CMKarting Zli\u010D\xEDn",k:["kart"],a:"Ringhofferova 115/1, Prague (listing cut off after the number)",area:"Zli\u010D\xEDn, western Prague",hrs:"Karts: Mon, Tue, Thu, Fri 11:00\u201323:00, Wed 11:00\u201322:00, Sat 10:00\u201323:00, Sun 10:00\u201322:00. Children's rides: weekdays until 17:00, weekends and holidays until 19:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"350 K\u010D per 10 min (adult or child), 400 K\u010D for a double kart. ISIC students 300 K\u010D per ride plus 50 K\u010D for a balaclava, weekdays 11:00\u201317:00 and Sundays 19:00\u201322:00",sd:"",d:"Indoor electric go-kart arena with a 690 m three-level track and a 30 degree banked turn. Adult, children's and two-seater karts. In Your Pocket says drivers from age five are accepted. Bistro on site.",src:[n.cmk,n.iyk],note:"The Mapnook listing shows no date. In Your Pocket gives the track as 700 m."},{id:"srr",n:"Ranger Prague",k:["shoot"],a:"Lubla\u0148sk\xE1 1729/23, Prague 2 (indoor range, metro C I. P. Pavlova)",area:"Near I. P. Pavlova",hrs:"Daily 09:00\u201322:00 (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Packages from around 2 000 K\u010D per person, including transfers, equipment, snacks and drinks (outdoor complex, per In Your Pocket)",sd:"7 May 2026",d:"Range run by former Czech Army and Police members, with an indoor range in the centre and an outdoor complex of 70 000 m\xB2 with ten open-air lanes (15 to 500 m). Takes groups of up to 60. Bring ID, a passport or a licence.",src:[n.rgr,n.iys],note:"Age: the FAQ says over 10 with a guardian, recommended from 12. Wear sturdy shoes and weather-appropriate clothing for outdoor visits. The price page was not read."},{id:"sra",n:"Prague Armory",k:["shoot"],a:"Near the city centre (street address not listed)",area:"Prague centre",hrs:"Mon\u2013Thu and Sun 10:00\u201320:00, Fri and Sat 10:00\u201322:00. Booking required (Google Maps, 17 Nov 2026)",pr:"Per person incl. pick-up, briefing, snack and drop-off, group of 2 / 10 / 16+: Basic (4 guns, 40 shots) 2 800 K\u010D / 2 575 K\u010D / 2 475 K\u010D. Standard (6 guns, 50 shots) 3 525 K\u010D / 3 300 K\u010D / 3 200 K\u010D. Exclusive (8 guns, 70 shots) 3 925 K\u010D / 3 725 K\u010D / 3 625 K\u010D",sd:"",d:"Indoor range with live firing of short and long firearms under instructor supervision, for beginners and experienced shooters. Groups are kept private. Outdoor packages and clay shooting are also offered. Minimum booking is two people.",src:[n.arm,n.iys],note:"The Mapnook page shows no date and its CZK prices do not match the euro prices, so only euros are listed. Confirm before booking. In Your Pocket says the selection leans toward handguns."},{id:"sr